<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.5">
<l>peruvaraṅka ḷavaipaṟṟip piḻakkuṭaiya virāvaṇaṉai</l>
<l>yuruvaraṅkap porutaḻittiv vulakiṉaikkaṇ peṟuttāṉūr</l>
<l>kuravarumpak kōṅkalarak kuyilkūvuṅ kuḷirpoḻilcūḻ</l>
<l>tiruvaraṅka meṉpatuvē yeṉtirumāl cērviṭamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of he who secured the protection of this world</l>
<l rend="indent">having utterly destroyed in battle</l>
<l rend="indent">the body of villanous Rāvaṇa,</l>
<l rend="indent">[who had] obtained great boons,</l>
<l>is called holy Araṅkam, the place associated with my Tirumāl,</l>
<l rend="indent">surrounded by cool groves where Cuckoos cry out</l>
<l rend="indent">while blue Kuravu flowers bud</l>
<l rend="indent">and red Kōṅku trees blossom.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
